


# Project Vision

## Pulse

### Tagline

> **The Operating System for Field Operations.**

---

## Mission

Empower every field-based organization to replace spreadsheets, WhatsApp, paper forms, disconnected software, and manual workflows with one intelligent cloud platform.

---

## Vision

Create the world's most comprehensive cloud platform for organizations whose employees work outside the office.

Rather than building another project management application, ForgeOS becomes the digital backbone of every field operation.

Whether a company builds skyscrapers, installs solar panels, repairs HVAC systems, maintains highways, manages telecom towers, or services industrial equipment, every operation runs through ForgeOS.

---

# The Problem

Field operations remain one of the least digitized industries.

Companies still rely on

* Excel
* Google Sheets
* WhatsApp
* Emails
* PDFs
* Phone calls
* Printed forms
* Clipboards
* Whiteboards

Information becomes fragmented.

Managers never have a complete picture.

Workers waste hours every day.

Documents are lost.

Equipment disappears.

Budgets exceed forecasts.

Safety incidents aren't reported properly.

Knowledge stays in people's heads.

AI cannot help because the data is scattered.

---

