# What should NOT be built

Don't build another project management tool like:

* Trello
* Jira
* Monday.com
* Asana

Construction companies don't need another Kanban board.

---


Make this **feel like a real company**, not just a portfolio project.

> **Don't call it an "Operations Platform."**

Every software today is an operations platform.

Instead, give it a category that sounds like something Gartner would recognize in 5 years.